reagent-desc-red-bell-poison = A fast-acting cardiovascular toxin that causes tremors, breathlessness and eventual collapse.
reagent-name-ash-viper-venom = ash viper venom
reagent-desc-ash-viper-venom = An aggressive wasteland venom that rapidly spreads through the bloodstream and leaves its victim weak and unsteady.
reagent-name-lazarus-compound = lazarus compound
reagent-desc-lazarus-compound = An experimental emergency serum capable of dragging a critically injured patient back from the edge, while inflicting severe cellular stress.
reagent-name-clearwake = clearwake
reagent-desc-clearwake = An emergency wakefulness drug that breaks through sedation and collapse long enough to keep a patient conscious.
reagent-name-widowbane = widowbane
reagent-desc-widowbane = A specialized antidote formulated to neutralize widow's mercy and relieve its respiratory effects.
reagent-name-cinder-serum = cinder serum
reagent-desc-cinder-serum = A specialized antidote designed to neutralize red bell poison and stabilize its victim.
reagent-name-gravesalt = gravesalt
reagent-desc-gravesalt = A brutal emergency purgative that clears several dangerous venoms at the cost of violent sickness and bodily strain.
reagent-name-misfits-clearhead = clearhead
reagent-desc-misfits-clearhead = A basic psychiatric stabilizer used to clear drug haze and reduce mild perceptual disturbances.
reagent-physical-desc-clear = clear
reagent-name-misfits-chlorpromazine = chlorpromazine
reagent-desc-misfits-chlorpromazine = A sedating antipsychotic intended to control agitation, delirium and hallucinations.
reagent-name-misfits-lucidine = lucidine
reagent-desc-misfits-lucidine = A refined neural stabilizer designed to suppress persistent hallucinations with less sedation than older antipsychotics.
reagent-name-misfits-psychocline = psychocline
reagent-desc-misfits-psychocline = A powerful emergency psychiatric drug used to suppress severe delirium and psychotic episodes, often leaving the patient heavily sedated.
reagent-name-misfits-neurostatic = neurostatic
reagent-desc-misfits-neurostatic = An advanced neurological stabilizer intended for severe hallucinations, toxic delirium and other forms of neural instability.
reagent-name-misfits-willowbark = willowbark analgesic
reagent-desc-misfits-willowbark = A bitter pouch of medicinal herbs that dulls persistent pain for a short time.
reagent-name-misfits-anodyne = anodyne
reagent-desc-misfits-anodyne = A basic clinical painkiller that suppresses chronic pain while producing mild drowsiness.
reagent-name-misfits-analgesine = analgesine
reagent-desc-misfits-analgesine = A refined long-lasting analgesic used when ordinary herbal pain relief is no longer sufficient.
reagent-name-misfits-nerveblock = nerveblock
reagent-desc-misfits-nerveblock = A heavy analgesic that strongly suppresses pain by numbing nerve activity, at the cost of sluggish movement and respiratory risk.
reagent-name-misfits-traumadol = traumadol
reagent-desc-misfits-traumadol = A battlefield analgesic that dulls pain while providing limited wound treatment and bleeding control.
reagent-name-misfits-anesthezine = anesthezine
reagent-desc-misfits-anesthezine = A surgical anesthetic that suppresses pain and induces profound sedation, with dangerous consequences at excessive doses.
reagent-name-misfits-neuroblock = neuroblock
reagent-desc-misfits-neuroblock = A high-grade neural analgesic that provides prolonged pain suppression with far less routine sedation than conventional nerve blockers.
reagent-name-misfits-neuroreguline = neuroreguline
reagent-desc-misfits-neuroreguline = An experimental neural regulator intended to suppress severe pain and stabilize disturbed perception at the same time.
reagent-name-misfits-wakeguard = wakeguard
reagent-desc-misfits-wakeguard = A maintenance drug for narcolepsy that keeps sudden sleep attacks at bay without significantly increasing physical performance.
reagent-name-misfits-somnoreguline = somnoreguline
reagent-desc-misfits-somnoreguline = An advanced sleep-regulation medicine that delays narcoleptic episodes for an extended period and can break through forced sleep.
reagent-name-misfits-vigilazine = vigilazine
reagent-desc-misfits-vigilazine = An inexpensive stimulant-derived medicine that postpones narcoleptic attacks without the extreme effects of combat stimulants.
reagent-name-movespeedmod-mixture = jet
reagent-desc-healing-mixture = A mixture of reagents that makes you heal.
drug-ambience-movespeed-mixture-1 = A bright rush hits your chest and legs at once.
drug-ambience-movespeed-mixture-2 = Stillness becomes intolerable as the chem bites in.
reagent-name-robust-movespeedmod-mixture = turbo
drug-ambience-robust-movespeed-mixture-1 = Your pulse spikes so hard the world seems to lag behind you.
drug-ambience-robust-movespeed-mixture-2 = The chem tears through you in a hot, reckless surge.
reagent-name-damage-mod-mixture = psycho
reagent-desc-damage-mod-mixture = A mixture of reagents that makes you stronger for a while.
drug-ambience-damage-modifying-mixture-1 = Your nerves harden into something mean and eager.
drug-ambience-damage-modifying-mixture-2 = Pain starts to feel far away and strangely unimportant.
reagent-name-daytripper = daytripper
reagent-desc-daytripper = The perfect escape for your horrible life.
drug-ambience-daytripper-1 = Colors loosen and drift somewhere just behind your eyes.
drug-ambience-daytripper-2 = A dreamy warmth pulls your thoughts away from the room.
reagent-name-cateye = cateye
reagent-desc-cateye = A reagent that improves your low-light vision.
reagent-physical-desc-glittery = glittery
drug-ambience-cateye-1 = The dark suddenly feels thinner.
drug-ambience-cateye-2 = Edges sharpen in the gloom until the shadows seem less trustworthy.
reagent-name-buffout = buffout
reagent-desc-buffout = A reagent that makes you overall more robust, for a short period of time.
reagent-physical-desc-fortifying = fortifying
drug-ambience-buffout-1 = A dense pressure swells through your muscles and chest.
drug-ambience-buffout-2 = You feel broader, heavier, and harder to ignore.
reagent-name-buffjet = buffjet
reagent-desc-buffjet = A reagent that combines the power of jet with the power of buffout, highly robust.
reagent-physical-desc-swirling = swirling
drug-ambience-buffjet-1 = A brutal cocktail of speed and muscle hits all at once.
drug-ambience-buffjet-2 = Your body wants to move, hit, and keep moving.
reagent-name-bufftats = bufftats
reagent-desc-bufftats = A reagent that combines the power of mentats with the power of buffout, highly robust.
drug-ambience-bufftats-1 = A hot iron confidence settles under your skin.
drug-ambience-bufftats-2 = The pain in your body dulls behind a thick chemical swagger.
reagent-name-mentats = mentats
reagent-desc-mentats = A reagent that makes you mentally sharper.
drug-ambience-mentats-1 = Your thoughts click into place with unnatural clarity.
drug-ambience-mentats-2 = Loose ideas line up and start making too much sense.
reagent-name-mentats-berry = berry mentats
reagent-desc-mentats-berry = A fruity reagent that makes you mentally sharper.
drug-ambience-mentats-berry-1 = A sweet artificial tang rides along a razor-clear focus.
drug-ambience-mentats-berry-2 = Your head feels bright and orderly beneath the candy flavor.
reagent-name-mentats-grape = grape mentats
reagent-desc-mentats-grape = A fruity reagent that makes you mentally sharper.
drug-ambience-mentats-grape-1 = A syrupy grape taste gives way to unnerving clarity.
drug-ambience-mentats-grape-2 = Your thoughts sharpen until they almost feel separate from you.
reagent-name-mentats-orange = orange mentats
reagent-desc-mentats-orange = A citrus reagent that makes you mentally sharper.
drug-ambience-mentats-orange-1 = Citrus bite flashes across your tongue before the focus settles in.
drug-ambience-mentats-orange-2 = Everything suddenly seems a little easier to sort and predict.
reagent-name-damage-resist-mixture = med-x
reagent-desc-damage-resist-mixture = An advanced painkiller that makes injuries easier to ignore.
drug-ambience-damage-resist-mixture-1 = A cold numb shield spreads through your body.
drug-ambience-damage-resist-mixture-2 = Pain starts bouncing off a layer that was not there a moment ago.
reagent-name-hydra = hydra
reagent-desc-hydra = A mixture of fungi, scorpion tail and nightstalker blood that works like a wasteland Med-X, dulling incoming damage at the cost of addiction.
drug-ambience-hydra-1 = Heat pulses through your veins in slow, angry waves.
drug-ambience-hydra-2 = Your heartbeat drums hard enough to drown out the room for a moment.
drug-ambience-hydra-3 = A coppery rush blooms behind your eyes and refuses to fully fade.
reagent-name-mourning-poultice = mourning poultice
reagent-desc-mourning-poultice = A mixture of poisonous crushed plants used in tribalistic ceremonies said to make you see gods.
drug-ambience-mourning-poultice-1 = Cold poison crawls through your veins, and the world starts to breathe around you.
drug-ambience-mourning-poultice-2 = The sting turns holy and wrong, dragging bright visions behind the pain.
reagent-name-healing-mixture = stimpak
drug-ambience-healing-mixture-1 = A clean medicinal surge races through your limbs.
drug-ambience-healing-mixture-2 = Your muscles tighten with a brief, borrowed strength.
reagent-name-dirty-stimpak = dirty stimpak
reagent-desc-dirty-stimpak = A dirty mixture of reagents that makes you heal.
drug-ambience-dirty-stimpak-1 = A rough chemical kick jerks your pulse awake.
drug-ambience-dirty-stimpak-2 = The rush works, but it feels grimy around the edges.
reagent-name-healing-powder = healing powder
reagent-desc-healing-powder = A powder made from crushed plants.
drug-ambience-healing-powder-1 = A chalky herbal film clings to the back of your throat.
drug-ambience-healing-powder-2 = Your focus softens as the powder settles warmly through your body.
drug-ambience-healing-powder-3 = The world smears at the edges behind a medicinal haze.
drug-ambience-trauma-powder-1 = A heavy numbness settles over the worst of the pain.
drug-ambience-trauma-powder-2 = Your injuries dull beneath a dusty, stubborn calm.
reagent-name-antidote-mixture = handmade antidote
reagent-desc-antidote-mixture = An antidote made from radscorpion tail and tarberry juice.
drug-ambience-antidote-mixture-1 = A sour medicinal coolness settles uneasily in your gut.
drug-ambience-antidote-mixture-2 = Your stomach lurches as the mixture starts pushing the poison out.
reagent-name-antidote = refined antidote
reagent-desc-antidote = A potent antitoxin without impurities. Treats poison and small amounts of radiation exposure.
drug-ambience-antidote-1 = A sharp chemical chill cuts through the poison fog.
drug-ambience-antidote-2 = Your insides feel scrubbed raw, but cleaner.
reagent-name-robust-healing-mixture = super stimpak
reagent-desc-robust-healing-mixture = A mixture of reagents that makes you heal fast.
drug-ambience-robust-healing-mixture-1 = A violent burst of strength floods your body all at once.
drug-ambience-robust-healing-mixture-2 = Your heart hammers like the medicine is dragging you upright by force.
reagent-name-radaway = radaway
reagent-desc-radaway = An odd reagent that cures your radiation.
drug-ambience-radaway-1 = A metallic warmth rolls through you as the sickness starts to recede.
drug-ambience-radaway-2 = A taste like rust lingers while the ache in your bones loosens.
reagent-name-diluted-radaway = diluted radaway
reagent-desc-diluted-radaway = A diluted odd reagent that cures your radiation at a slower rate.
drug-ambience-radaway-diluted-1 = A thin medicinal warmth takes the edge off the radiation sickness.
drug-ambience-radaway-diluted-2 = The relief comes slow and watery, but it comes.
reagent-name-cleansing-powder = cleansing powder
reagent-desc-cleansing-powder = a tribal remedy for radiation exposure developed by wasteland herbalists. Works slowly, inefficiently, and makes you drowsy, but it's better than the alternative.
reagent-physical-desc-scouring = scouring
drug-ambience-cleansing-powder-1 = A heavy, rolling wave of drowsiness begins to gnaw the rads away.
drug-ambience-cleansing-powder-2 = Warmth seeps into your veins as the powder begins to scour the sickness clean.
reagent-name-rad-x = rad-x
reagent-desc-rad-x = A reagent that makes you resistant to radiation.
drug-ambience-radx-1 = A dry chemical coat settles over your mouth and throat.
drug-ambience-radx-2 = Your skin prickles like something is bracing you from the inside.
reagent-name-fixer = fixer
reagent-desc-fixer = A reagent that cures your addictions.
drug-ambience-fixer-1 = The gnawing edge of withdrawal slackens for a while.
drug-ambience-fixer-2 = Your nerves stop scraping against each other, just for a moment.
reagent-name-smelling-salts = smelling salts
reagent-desc-smelling-salts = A grainy mixture of rocks with an insanely potent smell.
drug-ambience-smelling-salts-1 = A brutal sting clears your head in an instant.
drug-ambience-smelling-salts-2 = Your sinuses burn and your whole body jerks awake.
reagent-name-healing-poultice = healing poultice
reagent-desc-healing-poultice = A powder made from a large mixture of plants.
drug-ambience-healing-poultice-1 = A damp herbal heat seeps into your aches.
drug-ambience-healing-poultice-2 = The poultice smells earthy and stubbornly alive.
reagent-name-bitterdrink = bitterdrink
reagent-desc-bitterdrink = A mixture of crushed plants and brahmin milk boiled over a fire. Purges poison and radiation from body.
drug-ambience-bitterdrink-1 = The bitterness crawls across your tongue and settles deep.
drug-ambience-bitterdrink-2 = Your stomach twists, then steadies under the foul brew.
reagent-name-ultra-robust-healing-mixture = ultra stimpak
reagent-desc-ultra-robust-healing-mixture = A mixture of reagents that make you heal faster than you can feel it, however it comes with hefty side effects.
drug-ambience-ultra-robust-healing-mixture-1 = Power slams through your body hard enough to make your vision swim.
drug-ambience-ultra-robust-healing-mixture-2 = It feels less like healing and more like surviving the medicine.
reagent-name-epoetine = epoetine
reagent-desc-epoetine = A medicine that stimulates the lungs and encourages bloodflow.
reagent-name-beta-epoetine = beta epoetine
reagent-desc-beta-epoetine = A more potent medicine that stimulates the lungs and encourages bloodflow.
reagent-name-firetoxin = fire toxin
reagent-desc-firetoxin = The hot stuff from firey creatures.
